===Etymology===
{{PIE root|en|pleḱ}}
Borrowed from {{der|en|la|explicāre}}, present active infinitive of {{m|la|explicō||unfold, explain}}. {{rfv-etym|en}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|RP}} {{IPA|en|/ˈɛksplɪˌkeɪt/}}
* {{a|GA|weak vowel}} {{IPA|en|/ˈɛkspləˌkeɪt/}}
* {{hyph|en|ex|pli|cate}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb|explicat}}

# {{lb|en|transitive}} To [[explain]] [[meticulous]]ly or in great [[detail]]; to [[elucidate]]; to [[analyze]].
#: ''My homework is to '''explicate''' a poem.''

